- **Every request currently gets a 401.** `auth.js:8` reads `req.cookies`, but `app.js` never mounts `cookie-parser`, so `req.cookies` is always undefined. That means this bug can't be exploited yet. It will be as soon as cookies are wired up, so ship both fixes together.

