**Immutability.** `REVOKE UPDATE, DELETE ON audit_log FROM app_role;` — the app's DB user gets INSERT-only. If compliance needs tamper-evidence beyond "app can't touch it," add a hash chain (each row hashes its own content + previous row's hash) or periodically ship rows to WORM storage (S3 Object Lock, etc.).

