1. Add `audit_log` table + triggers on `accounts`, `orders` (and any other mutable tables) — captures everything DB-side immediately, even before app changes ship.
2. Extend `write()` to set `audit.actor_id` and update the two call sites (`accounts.js`, `orders.js`) to pass `req.user`.
3. Lock down grants on `audit_log`.
4. Add off-box export/replication.

